  "notes": [
    "Regular -IR verb with a spelling change: **gu → g before a/o**, to preserve the hard \"g\" sound",
    "Only affects the yo form of the presente (extingo, not \"extinguo\") and the entire subjuntivo presente (extinga, extingas...) — before e/i the u stays and is silent (extingues, extinguimos), so no change is needed there",
    "Regular past participle: **extinguido**",
    "Related reflexive verb: **extinguirse** (to go out / to die out, e.g. of a fire or a species)",
    "Common usage: *extinguir un incendio* (to put out a fire), *una especie en peligro de extinción* (an endangered species — note the related noun **extinción**)"
  ],
